OL,3,GNEWSANHS Grampian surgeon operated on
OL,4,Apatient while recovering from endoscopy
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn NHS Grampian surgeon took over a
OL,7,Fknee operation while he was recovering
OL,8,Ffrom a medical procedure and under the
OL,9,Finfluence of drugs, the BBC has
OL,10,Flearned.
OL,12,FThe doctor, who had to be driven to Dr
OL,13,FGray's hospital in Elgin, allegedly
OL,14,Fstepped in because a colleague felt
OL,15,Funable to complete the surgery.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
