OL,3,GNEWSANHS Grampian surgeon operated on
OL,4,Apatient while recovering from endoscopy
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a separate incident in the same
OL,7,Fdepartment, it is alleged that a
OL,8,Fsurgeon had a physical altercation with
OL,9,Fa registrar who suggested they were
OL,10,Fabout to replace the wrong hip of a
OL,11,Fpatient who was lying unconscious on
OL,12,Fthe operating table.
OL,14,FNHS Grampian said both matters were
OL,15,Faddressed at the time through the
OL,16,Fappropriate governance and employment
OL,17,Fprocesses, and immediate action had
OL,18,Fbeen taken.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
